      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "乖",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "（突然又低落下来）可是今天真的好难过...",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "怎么啦",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "（抽泣）就是...就是觉得好没用...",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "傻瓜，谁说你没用了",
        "phase": "phase_2"
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "（擦眼泪）可是...可是我真的好怕让你失望...",
